        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "兵隊（へいたい）　二小隊（にしょうたい）（士四十三人　卒五十一人）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Troops: two platoons — 43 shizoku (samurai-status) and 51 sotsu (lower-rank retainers), 94 men in all. The two-figure breakdown is printed as a warichu double column, shizoku on the right, sotsu on the left. Fascicle 8 prints a domain's military after its officials, so this column overflows past the ○蓮池藩 marker and belongs to Iwamurata, not Hasunoike."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "岩村田兵隊"
